        "title": "Oh, hey, welcome to Chaos Pocket",
        "content": {
            "$type": "app.offprint.content",
            "items": [
                {
                    "$type": "app.offprint.block.text",
                    "plaintext": "This'll be probably the 30th blog I've ever started, so we'll see how it goes, but the goal is to be a part of the broader blogging revival. You remember those days, right? "
                },
                {
                    "$type": "app.offprint.block.text",
                    "facets": [
                        {
                            "index": {
                                "byteEnd": 35,
                                "byteStart": 27
                            },
                            "features": [
                                {
                                    "uri": "https://offprint.app/",
                                    "$type": "app.offprint.richtext.facet#link"
                                },
                                {
                                    "$type": "app.offprint.richtext.facet#italic"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "plaintext": "I'm pretty damn pumped for Offprint. There have always been more than a few blogging platforms out there, some of them free and most of them somewhere between freemium and premium, but Offprint really feels like a product I can happily support. "
                },
                {
                    "$type": "app.offprint.block.text",
                    "plaintext": "It does have a premium 'Pro' option, but the free tier feels pretty feature-loaded. "
                },
                {
                    "$type": "app.offprint.block.image",
                    "image": {
                        "ref": {
                            "$link": "bafkreiaxcqe6ohemf2rnuk6fgzod5fpxtp3yovuuyet6akviosuuzd4yju"
                        },
                        "size": 84600,
                        "$type": "blob",
                        "mimeType": "image/png"
                    },
                    "alignment": "center",
                    "aspectRatio": {
                        "width": 659,
                        "height": 558
                    }
                },
                {
                    "$type": "app.offprint.block.text",
                    "plaintext": "For now, it feels a lot like the Ghost platform, and to that end it even has a newsletter engine built-in! "
                },
                {
                    "$type": "app.offprint.block.text",
                    "facets": [
                        {
                            "index": {
                                "byteEnd": 125,
                                "byteStart": 105
                            },
                            "features": [
                                {
                                    "uri": "https://atproto.com/guides/overview",
                                    "$type": "app.offprint.richtext.facet#link"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "index": {
                                "byteEnd": 163,
                                "byteStart": 150
                            },
                            "features": [
                                {
                                    "uri": "https://standard.site/",
                                    "$type": "app.offprint.richtext.facet#link"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "plaintext": "Even in its beta form, it's overflowing with features and capabilities, and the fact that it's tied into the ATProto platform \u2013\u00a0and the associated standard.site architecture \u2013 feels like a big plus to me. "
                },
                {
                    "$type": "app.offprint.block.text",
                    "plaintext": "So, yeah. Keen to see how this evolves! "
                },
                {
                    "$type": "app.offprint.block.text",
                    "facets": [
                        {
                            "index": {
                                "byteEnd": 33,
                                "byteStart": 0
                            },
                            "features": [
                                {
                                    "$type": "app.offprint.richtext.facet#bold"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "plaintext": "My wishlist for now is mainly... "
