                    ]
                },
                {
                    "$type": "app.offprint.block.text",
                    "plaintext": "On Chaos Pocket, I'll be posting about all the things I enjoy: photography, cameras and related accessories, along with all the pocketable gadgets and trinkets and tools that I can't ever seem to resist. "
                },
                {
                    "$type": "app.offprint.block.text",
                    "plaintext": "I'll also post about things I find online, such as new fave artists, movie and TV trailers, music, clothes, toys and models... all of those \"surely there are smarter ways to use your money\" things. "
